# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of the
# checkout platform's line-ending convention. Added after the working tree
# accumulated ~100 files that diffed as 100% CRLF/LF churn with no content
# change, which was starting to mask real diffs. One-time fix: this file,
# plus a single `git add --renormalize .` commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary/generated artifacts: leave untouched, no line-ending conversion.
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
